{"content":[{"c":["HASHABIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":[" 1. Ancestor of Ethan, a Levite and descendant of Merari. Ethan was a musician in the temple during the reign of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.45","r":"1Chr.6.45","rawR":"1Chr.6.45","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.45","value":"1Chr.6.45"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:45"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 2. Ancestor of a group of Levites who helped rebuild the temple after the Babylonian exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.14","r":"1Chr.9.14","rawR":"1Chr.9.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.14","value":"1Chr.9.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.15","r":"Neh.11.15","rawR":"Neh.11.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.15","value":"Neh.11.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 3. Jeduthun’s son, a Levite and musician in the temple during the time of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.3,19","r":"1Chr.25.3,19","rawR":"1Chr.25.3,19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.3,19","value":"1Chr.25.3,19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:3, 19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 4. Head of a group of Hebronites who was given the position of overseer of Israel west of the Jordan. He was in charge of both political and religious activities (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.30","r":"1Chr.26.30","rawR":"1Chr.26.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.30","value":"1Chr.26.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:30"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 5. Kemuel’s son, a Levite and head of a household during the reign of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.17","r":"1Chr.27.17","rawR":"1Chr.27.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.17","value":"1Chr.27.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 6. Chief of the Levites who participated in the Passover kept by King Josiah in the kingdom of Judah (640–609 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.35.9","r":"2Chr.35.9","rawR":"2Chr.35.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.35.9","value":"2Chr.35.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 35:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 7. Merarite Levite who returned to Jerusalem from Babylon with Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.19","r":"Ezra.8.19","rawR":"Ezra.8.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.19","value":"Ezra.8.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 8. Priest who returned to Jerusalem from Babylon with Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.24","r":"Ezra.8.24","rawR":"Ezra.8.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.24","value":"Ezra.8.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:24"},"); perhaps the same person as #7 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 9. Parosh’s son, who obeyed Ezra’s exhortation to divorce his pagan wife after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.25","r":"Ezra.10.25","rawR":"Ezra.10.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.25","value":"Ezra.10.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:25"},"); possibly the same as Asibias (",{"href":"?bref=1Esd.9.26","r":"1Esd.9.26","rawR":"1Esd.9.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Esd.9.26","value":"1Esd.9.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Esd 9:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["10. Ruler over half the district of Keilah (a city of Judah in the Shephelah district of Libnah-mareshah) who participated in rebuilding the Jerusalem wall for his district after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.17","r":"Neh.3.17","rawR":"Neh.3.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.17","value":"Neh.3.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["11. Levite who signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.11","r":"Neh.10.11","rawR":"Neh.10.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.11","value":"Neh.10.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["12. Ancestor of Uzzi, an overseer of Levites in Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.22","r":"Neh.11.22","rawR":"Neh.11.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.22","value":"Neh.11.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["13. Priest and head of a household in Palestine after the exile during the time of the high priest Joiakim (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.21","r":"Neh.12.21","rawR":"Neh.12.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.21","value":"Neh.12.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["14. Chief of the Levites and a temple musician after the exile during the time of Joiakim the high priest (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.24","r":"Neh.12.24","rawR":"Neh.12.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.24","value":"Neh.12.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:24"},"); perhaps the same person as #11 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hashabiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:45","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.45","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.45","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.45"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.14","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.14","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.14"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.15","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.15","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.15"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:3, 19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.3,19","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.3,19","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.3,19"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 26:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.26.30","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.26.30","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.26.30"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.17"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 35:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.35.9","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.35.9","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.35.9"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.19","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.19","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.19"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.24","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.24","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.24"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.25","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.25","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.25"},{"anchorText":"1 Esd 9:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Esd.9.26","rawQueryValue":"1Esd.9.26","sourceRefExact":"1Esd.9.26"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.17","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.17","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.17"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.11","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.11","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.11"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.22","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.22","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.22"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.21","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.21","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.21"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.24","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.24","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.24"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"815b13ce763eef6e35c41eee07ff663b24e80966a352235535665ab306ea27a5","sourceItemName":"Hashabiah","sourceItemOrder":138,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Hashabiah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hashabiah","title